{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.829999923706055,"text":"A small studio with a camera, lights, and a brightly lit green sheet. You stand in front of it, and on the screen beside you, appear flying over Paris or standing on the moon. The trick is simple, and you understand it the moment you do it. The computer deletes one particular color and puts a picture in its place, which is why you must not wear anything green, or you will go see-through too.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5799999833106995},{"word":"small","start":0.5799999833106995,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"studio","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"with","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"a","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"camera","start":2.299999952316284,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"lights","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"and","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.4600000381469727},{"word":"a","start":3.4600000381469727,"end":3.700000047683716},{"word":"brightly","start":3.700000047683716,"end":4},{"word":"lit","start":4,"end":4.400000095367432},{"word":"green","start":4.400000095367432,"end":4.840000152587891},{"word":"sheet","start":4.840000152587891,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"You","start":5.760000228881836,"end":5.980000019073486},{"word":"stand","start":5.980000019073486,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"in","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.460000038146973},{"word":"front","start":6.460000038146973,"end":6.480000019073486},{"word":"of","start":6.480000019073486,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"it","start":6.639999866485596,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"and","start":6.920000076293945,"end":7.079999923706055},{"word":"on","start":7.079999923706055,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"the","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.420000076293945},{"word":"screen","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.639999866485596},{"word":"beside","start":7.6399998664855